label opening_cutscene:

    scene black
    with fade

    pause 1.0

    centered "..."

    pause 1.0

    n "Everything is dark."

    n "I can't see anything."

    pause 1.0

    n "But I can feel the ground beneath me."

    n "I'm somewhere underground."

    pause 1.0

    return